# How Neural Networks Learn from Experience.

**Authors:** Hinton, Geoffrey E.

## Abstract
Discusses computational studies of learning in artificial neural networks and findings that may provide insights into the learning abilities of the human brain. Describes efforts to test theories about brain information processing, using artificial neural networks. Vignettes include information concerning how a neural network represents handwritten digits, the back-propagation algorithm, and neuron processes. (MCO)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ458272

